<https://example.org/uiuc-course-advisor/resource/course/ECE544> a uca:Course ;
    rdfs:label "ECE 544 Topics in Signal Processing" ;
    uca:courseCode "ECE 544" ;
    uca:courseCreditsMax 4.0 ;
    uca:courseCreditsMin 4.0 ;
    uca:courseDescription "Lectures and discussions related to advanced topics and new areas of interest in signal processing: speech, image, and multidimensional processing. May be repeated 8 hours in a term to a total of 20 hours. Credit towards a degree from multiple offerings of this course is not given if those offerings have significant overlap, as determined by the ECE department. Prerequisite: As specified each term. It is expected that each offering will have a 500-level course as prerequisite or co-requisite." ;
